    "key_features_eA8hEF": {
      "type": "key-features",
      "blocks": {
        "feature_QhnUwi": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Focused_Student_Mask.png",
            "bg_color": "#595378",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "CBG And CBD For Focus",
            "text": "<p>We talk a lot about CBD here at HempLucid, and for good reason. In addition to helping us <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/stress-support\" title=\"Stress Support\">FIGHT STRESS</a> and find <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/sleep-support\" title=\"Sleep Support\">DEEPER SLEEP</a> (without next-day grogginess), CBD can help induce a state of relaxed calm that helps us feel sharp, clear, and “in the zone.” As the major non-intoxicating compound in cannabis and hemp, CBD is an all-natural all-star when it comes to helping us access better <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33551817/\" title=\"Mental Clarity and Focus\">MENTAL CLARITY AND FOCUS</a>.  </p><p><br/>Then there’s CBG, another cannabinoid that’s attracting a lot of attention. Like CBD, CBG isn’t intoxicating, and it supports our health with anxiety-reducing, anti-inflammatory, and neuroprotective qualities. As <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9666035/\" title=\"Pharmacological Aspects and Biological Effects of Cannabigerol and Its Synthetic Derivatives\">THIS EARLY STUDY</a> suggests, it’s an all-natural compound we’ll be hearing much, much more about in the years to come.</p>",
            "read_more": false,
            "read_more_external": false,
            "read_more_url": "",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
            "active_segment": "1",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_nyPMHr": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Chaga_Mushroom_in_a_Mask3.png",
            "bg_color": "#ffd700",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#002531",
            "heading": "Mushrooms For Focus",
            "text": "<p>As powerful as CBD and CBG are, they’re not the only compounds we lean on here at HempLucid. Since the earliest days of Chinese medicine, humans have known that adaptogens and functional mushrooms such as chaga have the potential to help us manage stress and achieve deeper focus without intoxication. And here at HempLucid, one of the mushrooms we lean most on is Lion’s Mane.  </p><p><br/>In addition to promising data suggesting that Lion’s Mane can enhance the activities of neurotransmitters, Lion's Mane compounds have been shown to potentially <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24266378/\" title=\"Neurotrophic properties of the Lion's mane medicinal mushroom\">INCREASE THE LEVELS OF NERVE GROWTH FACTOR</a> (NGF) in the brain. NGF is a protein that plays an important role in the health of nerve cells, which is vital for cognitive function, memory, and concentration.</p>",
            "read_more": false,
            "read_more_external": false,
            "read_more_url": "",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
            "active_segment": "2",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
